<div id="win" class="screen">

    <h1>🎀 YOU WON 🎀</h1>

    <div class="final">

        <p>
            YOU ACTUALLY DID IT.
        </p>

        <p>
            You survived all
            <strong>15 challenges</strong>
            without giving up.
        </p>

        <p>
